<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-14117] Travis ignores JVM_EXTRA_ARGS</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-14117</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Travis failed to resolve some dependencies on jdk.11.0.2. Reason is JDK bug &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;. Workaround is setup&#160;-Djdk.tls.client.protocols=TLSv1.2.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;But it&apos;s incorrect to setup it within JVM_EXTRA_ARGS. Maven use MAVEN_OPTS for that&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://bugs.java.com/bugdatabase/view_bug.do?bug_id=8220723&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://bugs.java.com/bugdatabase/view_bug.do?bug_id=8220723&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
